@startuml runtime_topology
' Callosum runtime topology — process/module view plus the self-observation
' and dev-loop path that can produce transform-only review branches.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #444444
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #FFE4B5
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #444444
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #E6F3FF
skinparam FolderBorderColor #444444
skinparam FolderBackgroundColor #EEF7E6

left to right direction

actor "OpenAI-compatible\nclients" as Clients

package "artifact-backed service" as ServiceRuntime {
  component "systemd user service\nExecStart: runtime venv\nbin/callosum serve" as ServiceUnit
  folder "~/.local/share/callosum\n/runtime/venv" as RuntimeVenv
  component "installed callosum CLI\nservice start/stop/restart/status" as RuntimeCli
}

package "callosum FastAPI process" as Proxy {
  component "API surface\n/v1/responses\n/v1/chat/completions" as API
  component "Router\nfeatures -> capability filter\n-> predictor -> selector" as Router
  component "Transform registry\nsrc/callosum/transforms/" as Transforms
  component "Backend dispatch" as Dispatch
  component "Capability harness\n6h sweeps" as Harness
  component "Canary + failure registry" as Canary
}

package "Backends" as Backends {
  component "Codex auth vaults\nremote Plus/Pro" as Codex
  component "LocalModelRegistryBackend\npreferred local lanes" as Local
  component "LiteLLMGatewayBackend\nfallback local gateway" as LiteLLM
}

database "operator_state.sqlite\nmode, denylist,\nprobe results" as OperatorState
database "requests.sqlite\nusage log +\nfailure observations" as UsageLog
folder "logs/capability_profiles/*.json\nmodel research inputs" as Profiles
database "autonomy.sqlite\nlevel + audit log" as Autonomy

package "scheduled auto-dev loop" as AutoDev {
  component "systemd timer\ncallosum-dev-loop.timer" as Timer
  component "Perception snapshot\nprofiles + canary + failures\n+ transform commits" as Perception
  component "Pre-filter gate\ngap-triage action / canary divergence\n/ recent transform failures" as Gate
  component "External coding agent\nCALLOSUM_DEV_LOOP_AGENT" as Agent
  component "Scope + test gate\ntransforms only\nruff + pytest" as Verify
  folder "auto/dev-loop-*\nreview branches" as Branches
}

Clients --> API : HTTP on 127.0.0.1
ServiceUnit --> RuntimeVenv : runs installed artifact
RuntimeVenv --> RuntimeCli
RuntimeCli --> ServiceUnit : operator service control
ServiceUnit --> API : starts FastAPI process
API --> OperatorState : read routing mode\nand denylist
API --> Router : route request
Router --> Transforms : apply selected\ncell transforms
Router --> Dispatch : chosen cell
Dispatch --> Codex
Dispatch --> Local
Dispatch --> LiteLLM
API --> UsageLog : record request,\nstatus, tokens

Harness --> Dispatch : direct cell probes
Harness --> OperatorState : read/write probe cache
Harness --> Profiles : write findings\nand adapter hints
Canary --> UsageLog : failure observations\nand mode stats

Timer --> Perception : every 6h
Perception --> Profiles : read
Perception --> UsageLog : read-only stats
Perception --> Transforms : recent transform commits
Perception --> Gate
Gate --> Autonomy : record skips/failures/successes
Gate --> Agent : invoke only when\nactionable signal exists
Agent --> Transforms : allowed edits
Agent --> Verify
Verify --> Branches : commit only if\nscope and tests pass

note bottom of Agent
  The agent cannot push, merge,
  or edit router/backends/harness.
end note

note right of Branches
  Operator reviews and merges
  manually.
end note

@enduml
